  "notes": [
    "Impersonal verb — used only in 3rd person singular; all other forms are marked —",
    "o→ue stem change in present and subjuntivo: *llueve*, *llueva*",
    "No stem change in preterite, imperfect, future, or conditional",
    "Past participle: *llovido*",
    "*llueve* = it's raining; *llovió* = it rained; *llovía* = it was raining; *lloverá* = it will rain",
    "*llover a cántaros* = to rain cats and dogs (*Está lloviendo a cántaros* — It's pouring)",
    "Related: *la lluvia* = rain; *lluvioso/a* = rainy; *la llovizna* = drizzle; *lloviznar* = to drizzle"
  ],
